.DS_Store
.claude/
*.log
# Write-to-temp residue from tools/admin-server.mjs (`.<file>.tmp-<pid>`,
# renamed into place on success). SHIP stages with `git add -A`, so a crash
# between the write and the rename would otherwise be committed and pushed.
*.tmp-*
# tools/feed-watch.mjs's per-machine memory (when it last ran here, and how
# the last runs went). tools/feed-health.json beside it is shared and is
# committed; this is timer state for one box.
tools/feed-watch-state.json
dist/
node_modules/
# The site's markets.json is built by the workflow (or `npm run markets`).
# Anchored at the root: unanchored, this also ignored the parsers' fixture,
# tests/fixtures/markets.json, so a fresh clone's tests had nothing to read.
/markets.json
_site/
# Secrets. SHIP stages with `git add -A` and pushes, so a key file dropped
# in the working tree would be published to the repo (and, if the static
# allowlist ever let it, to the site). Nothing here needs one; if something
# ever does, it must not be one of these names in the tree.
.env
.env.*
*.local.json
*secret*
service-account*.json
*.pem
*.key
